{"title":"Career roadmap · Scientist/Engineer (ISRO/DRDO/HAL)","role":"Scientist/Engineer (ISRO/DRDO/HAL)","summary":"This career target needs an important distinction: ISRO, DRDO and HAL are different organisations with different recruitment systems and job profiles.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Aerospace graduate engineer, project/research intern, technical trainee or eligible Scientist/Engineer recruitment candidate"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"What should I specialise in?","output":"Propulsion, structures, aerodynamics, GNC, avionics, thermal or flight systems"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Senior Scientist/Engineer, subsystem specialist, project engineer or technical lead"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How do I remain relevant?","output":"Principal Scientist/Engineer, subsystem/project lead, programme manager or aerospace R&D leader"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Aerospace/Aeronautical Engineering graduate can target:"},{"type":"note","label":"ISRO","text":"spacecraft, launch vehicles, propulsion, structures, avionics, guidance/navigation/control, thermal systems, testing and mission engineering."},{"type":"note","label":"DRDO","text":"defence aerospace, missiles, UAVs, propulsion, aerodynamics, structures, guidance/control, materials, testing and defence systems."},{"type":"note","label":"HAL","text":"aircraft/helicopter/engine manufacturing, design, production, maintenance, avionics integration, testing and aerospace systems."},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, the best undergraduate strategy is to develop a strong aerospace engineering core + one deep technical specialisation + programming/simulation + research/project evidence."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"ISRO, DRDO and HAL recruitment rules, post names, age limits, disciplines, GATE requirements and vacancies vary by recruitment cycle. Treat the specific recruitment notification as authoritative."}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build this","Key skills","Proof of progress"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Engineering foundation"},{"text":"Mathematics, physics, mechanics, programming, engineering graphics"},{"text":"Mathematical/simulation mini-projects"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Aerospace core"},{"text":"Aerodynamics, thermodynamics, fluid mechanics, materials, structures"},{"text":"Aircraft/rocket subsystem simulations"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Aerospace specialisation"},{"text":"Propulsion, GNC, avionics, CFD, structures or flight systems"},{"text":"Advanced technical project + internship"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"R&D/recruitment preparation"},{"text":"System integration, simulation, testing, technical documentation"},{"text":"Major aerospace capstone + competitive-exam/recruitment preparation"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Engineering foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Calculus"},{"text":"Differential equations"},{"text":"Linear algebra"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Numerical methods"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Physics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mechanics"},{"text":"Thermodynamics"},{"text":"Electricity and magnetism"},{"text":"Waves"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mechanics"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Engineering graphics"},{"text":"Basic electronics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"C/C++"},{"text":"MATLAB/Octave"},{"text":"Git"},{"text":"Linux fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a flight/trajectory simulation."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Initial conditions","Equations of motion","Numerical integration","Trajectory","Visualisation"]},{"type":"p","text":"Calculate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Altitude"},{"text":"Velocity"},{"text":"Range"},{"text":"Acceleration"},{"text":"Drag"},{"text":"Gravity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Aerospace core"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"h","text":"Aerodynamics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fluid mechanics"},{"text":"Continuity equation"},{"text":"Bernoulli equation"},{"text":"Boundary layers"},{"text":"Lift"},{"text":"Drag"},{"text":"Airfoils"},{"text":"Compressible flow"},{"text":"Shock waves"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Aircraft mechanics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft performance"},{"text":"Stability"},{"text":"Flight dynamics"},{"text":"Weight and balance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Thermodynamics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"First/second laws"},{"text":"Gas turbines"},{"text":"Thermodynamic cycles"},{"text":"Heat transfer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Aerospace materials"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aluminium alloys"},{"text":"Titanium"},{"text":"Composites"},{"text":"High-temperature materials"},{"text":"Fatigue"},{"text":"Fracture"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Perform airfoil/wing aerodynamic analysis."},{"type":"p","text":"Compare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Angle of attack"},{"text":"Lift coefficient"},{"text":"Drag coefficient"},{"text":"Lift-to-drag ratio"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use analytical calculations plus simulation where possible."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Choose a specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"This decision matters significantly."},{"type":"h","text":"Option 1 — Propulsion"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gas turbines"},{"text":"Jet engines"},{"text":"Rocket propulsion"},{"text":"Combustion"},{"text":"Nozzles"},{"text":"Turbomachinery"},{"text":"Propellant fundamentals"},{"text":"Engine performance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential direction:"},{"type":"h","text":"Propulsion Scientist/Engineer"},{"type":"h","text":"Option 2 — Aerodynamics / CFD"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CFD"},{"text":"Numerical methods"},{"text":"Turbulence"},{"text":"Compressible flow"},{"text":"Meshing"},{"text":"OpenFOAM/ANSYS Fluent or equivalent tools"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential direction:"},{"type":"h","text":"Aerodynamics/CFD Scientist/Engineer"},{"type":"h","text":"Option 3 — Structures"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Structural mechanics"},{"text":"Finite Element Analysis"},{"text":"Composite structures"},{"text":"Fatigue"},{"text":"Fracture mechanics"},{"text":"Vibration"},{"text":"Modal analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential direction:"},{"type":"h","text":"Aerospace Structural Scientist/Engineer"},{"type":"h","text":"Option 4 — Guidance, Navigation & Control"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Control systems"},{"text":"State-space"},{"text":"Kalman filters"},{"text":"Navigation"},{"text":"Sensor fusion"},{"text":"Flight dynamics"},{"text":"Trajectory optimisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential direction:"},{"type":"h","text":"GNC Scientist/Engineer"},{"type":"h","text":"Option 5 — Avionics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Embedded systems"},{"text":"Digital electronics"},{"text":"Microcontrollers"},{"text":"Sensors"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Data buses"},{"text":"Real-time systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential direction:"},{"type":"h","text":"Avionics Scientist/Engineer"},{"type":"h","text":"Option 6 — Spacecraft systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Orbital mechanics"},{"text":"Spacecraft subsystems"},{"text":"Attitude determination/control"},{"text":"Thermal control"},{"text":"Power systems"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Spacecraft structures"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential direction:"},{"type":"h","text":"Spacecraft Systems Engineer"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4 — Build research capability"},{"type":"p","text":"Aerospace R&D organisations value the ability to solve engineering problems systematically."},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Numerical modelling"},{"text":"Simulation"},{"text":"Experimental design"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Technical writing"},{"text":"Requirements analysis"},{"text":"Verification and validation"},{"text":"System engineering"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn tools appropriate to your specialisation:"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Tools"],"rows":[[{"text":"Aerodynamics"},{"text":"MATLAB, Python, OpenFOAM, CFD software"}],[{"text":"Structures"},{"text":"ANSYS, Abaqus, MATLAB"}],[{"text":"Propulsion"},{"text":"MATLAB, CFD, thermodynamic simulation"}],[{"text":"GNC"},{"text":"MATLAB/Simulink, Python, C++"}],[{"text":"Avionics"},{"text":"C/C++, MATLAB/Simulink, embedded tools"}],[{"text":"Space systems"},{"text":"MATLAB, Python, orbital simulation"}],[{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"CAD, CAM, GD&T, PLM"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-year project"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong project should resemble an R&D engineering problem, not just a classroom prototype."},{"type":"h","text":"Example 1 — GNC"},{"type":"h","text":"Autonomous Launch Vehicle/Drone Guidance and Control Simulation"},{"type":"flow","items":["Vehicle Model","Sensors","State Estimator","Guidance","Controller","Actuators"]},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"6-DOF modelling"},{"text":"IMU/GPS measurements"},{"text":"Kalman filtering"},{"text":"PID/LQR control"},{"text":"Trajectory tracking"},{"text":"Disturbance testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example 2 — Aerodynamics"},{"type":"h","text":"CFD Analysis and Optimisation of an Aerospace Wing"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airfoil geometry"},{"text":"Angle of attack"},{"text":"Lift"},{"text":"Drag"},{"text":"Pressure distribution"},{"text":"L/D ratio"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example 3 — Propulsion"},{"type":"h","text":"Jet/Rocket Propulsion Performance Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pressure"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Mass flow"},{"text":"Thrust"},{"text":"Specific impulse"},{"text":"Nozzle performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example 4 — Structures"},{"type":"h","text":"Finite Element Analysis of an Aerospace Structural Component"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stress"},{"text":"Deformation"},{"text":"Fatigue"},{"text":"Buckling"},{"text":"Safety factor"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4-year honours variant"},{"type":"p","text":"Use the additional research opportunity for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computational aerodynamics"},{"text":"Hypersonics"},{"text":"Propulsion"},{"text":"GNC"},{"text":"Autonomous flight"},{"text":"Spacecraft systems"},{"text":"Composite structures"},{"text":"Additive manufacturing"},{"text":"UAV systems"},{"text":"Space robotics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A research paper, conference presentation or substantial laboratory project can be particularly valuable for an R&D-oriented pathway."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Core stack","Potential role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Aerodynamics"},{"text":"CFD, fluid mechanics"},{"text":"Aerodynamics Engineer"}],[{"text":"Propulsion"},{"text":"Thermodynamics, combustion, turbomachinery"},{"text":"Propulsion Engineer"}],[{"text":"Structures"},{"text":"FEA, composites, fatigue"},{"text":"Structural Engineer"}],[{"text":"GNC"},{"text":"Control, estimation, navigation"},{"text":"GNC Engineer"}],[{"text":"Avionics"},{"text":"Embedded systems, electronics"},{"text":"Avionics Engineer"}],[{"text":"Spacecraft"},{"text":"Orbital mechanics, attitude control"},{"text":"Spacecraft Engineer"}],[{"text":"Flight Systems"},{"text":"Systems engineering, testing"},{"text":"Flight Systems Engineer"}],[{"text":"UAVs"},{"text":"Autonomy, controls, embedded systems"},{"text":"UAV Engineer"}],[{"text":"Hypersonics"},{"text":"Compressible flow, thermal protection"},{"text":"Hypersonics Research Engineer"}],[{"text":"Aerospace Manufacturing"},{"text":"CAD, CAM, composites, quality"},{"text":"Manufacturing Engineer"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For this career, research-oriented internships are particularly valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"ISRO"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential exposure areas can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Launch vehicles"},{"text":"Spacecraft"},{"text":"Propulsion"},{"text":"Structures"},{"text":"Avionics"},{"text":"GNC"},{"text":"Thermal systems"},{"text":"Remote sensing"},{"text":"Space applications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"ISRO","url":"https://www.isro.gov.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"DRDO"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missiles"},{"text":"UAVs"},{"text":"Aerodynamics"},{"text":"Propulsion"},{"text":"Guidance and control"},{"text":"Avionics"},{"text":"Radar"},{"text":"Defence systems"},{"text":"Materials"}]},{"type":"p","text":"DRDO","url":"https://www.drdo.gov.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"HAL"},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft design"},{"text":"Aircraft manufacturing"},{"text":"Helicopters"},{"text":"Aircraft structures"},{"text":"Engines"},{"text":"Avionics"},{"text":"Maintenance"},{"text":"Testing"},{"text":"Production engineering"}]},{"type":"p","text":"HAL","url":"https://hal-india.co.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"Other valuable routes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CSIR laboratories"},{"text":"IIT/IISc aerospace laboratories"},{"text":"National aerospace research organisations"},{"text":"Private aerospace companies"},{"text":"UAV/drone companies"},{"text":"Space startups"},{"text":"Aircraft component manufacturers"}]},{"type":"p","text":"CSIR\nIISc","url":"https://www.csir.res.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"Internship priority"},{"type":"p","text":"For this particular career:"},{"type":"flow","items":["R&D laboratory","aerospace company engineering internship","manufacturing internship","generic engineering internship"]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Learning route","Why it matters"],"rows":[[{"text":"NPTEL Aerospace courses"},{"text":"Strong theoretical foundation"}],[{"text":"MATLAB/Simulink"},{"text":"Modelling and control"}],[{"text":"CFD training"},{"text":"Aerodynamics"}],[{"text":"ANSYS/FEA training"},{"text":"Structures"}],[{"text":"OpenFOAM"},{"text":"Open-source CFD"}],[{"text":"Python scientific computing"},{"text":"Engineering analysis"}],[{"text":"CAD/GD&T"},{"text":"Aerospace design/manufacturing"}],[{"text":"Systems engineering"},{"text":"Large aerospace programmes"}],[{"text":"Embedded systems"},{"text":"Avionics/GNC"}],[{"text":"Control systems"},{"text":"GNC/flight control"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"NPTEL\nMathWorks\nOpenFOAM","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"For ISRO/DRDO/HAL, certificates do not replace the required academic qualifications and recruitment criteria. Prioritise GATE/recruitment preparation, core engineering knowledge, projects and research experience."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct/closely related roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scientist/Engineer"},{"text":"Aerospace Engineer"},{"text":"Aeronautical Engineer"},{"text":"Graduate Engineer Trainee"},{"text":"Propulsion Engineer"},{"text":"Aerodynamics Engineer"},{"text":"CFD Engineer"},{"text":"Structural Engineer"},{"text":"Flight Dynamics Engineer"},{"text":"GNC Engineer"},{"text":"Avionics Engineer"},{"text":"Flight Systems Engineer"},{"text":"Spacecraft Systems Engineer"},{"text":"UAV Engineer"},{"text":"Aerospace Test Engin